 `isBlocked“ state in the database and create a UI to block customers."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7","children":"Then, every time a request is received that involves reading or altering sensitive data, make sure to check this flag."}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"id":"can-i-use-something-else-than-cookies","className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-8 x:text-2xl","children":["Can I use something else than cookies?",["$","$La",null,{"id":"can-i-use-something-else-than-cookies"}]]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7","children":["Yes, we expose ",["$","code",null,{"className":"nextra-code","dir":"ltr","children":"sealData"}]," and ",["$","code",null,{"className":"nextra-code","dir":"ltr","children":"unsealData"}]," which are not tied to cookies. This way you can seal and unseal any object in your application and move seals around to login users."]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"id":"how-is-this-different-from-jwt","className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-8 x:text-2xl","children":[["How is this different from ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://jwt.io/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","className":"x:focus-visible:nextra-focus x:text-primary-600 x:underline x:hover:no-underline x:decoration-from-font x:[text-underline-position:from-font]","children":["JWT",[" ",["$","svg",null,{"fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","strokeWidth":1.7,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","height":"1em","className":"x:inline x:align-baseline x:shrink-0","children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M7 17L17 7"}],["$","path",null,{"d":"M7 7h10v10"}]]}]]]}],"?"],["$","$La",null,{"id":"how-is-this-different-from-jwt"}]]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7","children":"Not so much:"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className